      "short_description": "RAWFISH is a mobile-first digital agency based in Vicenza, Italy, founded in 2012. The company specializes in mobile app development, web applications, UI/UX design, and technologies such as IoT, chatbots, and smart sensors. RAWFISH emphasizes high-quality, engaging digital solutions tailored for both startups and enterprises.\n\nThe agency operates with a philosophy of \"DESIGN SURF CODE,\" blending technology, creativity, and nature. Its team consists of skilled designers, user experience professionals, and developers who are dedicated to delivering robust and visually appealing products. With locations in Vicenza, Milan, and Jakarta, RAWFISH has a workforce of approximately 12-41 employees and reported a turnover of €2M in 2021. The agency focuses on creating native iOS and Android apps, web applications, and mobile digital strategies that meet enterprise standards.",
